---
description: Git 커밋/PR에 Cursor Co-authored 표기를 넣지 않음
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to git commits or PR descriptions.
- When creating commits, use only the requested commit message body — no attribution footers.
